# Next.js (App Router)

- This is **not** legacy Next — read `AGENTS.md` and `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before using unfamiliar APIs.
- Default to **Server Components**. Add `'use client'` only for motion, pointer, or browser APIs (client islands).
- Use `next/font` for Cormorant Garamond, Manrope, Montserrat (Step 2+).
- Use `next/image` for bottle/atmosphere assets; set **`priority`** on the hero bottle.
- Keep routes under `src/app/`. Shared UI under `src/components/`; content in `src/content/`; GSAP bootstrap in `src/lib/gsap.ts`.
- Do not add Pages Router patterns or deprecated Image/Font APIs.
